            "review_title": "Review at Coffee Vien's",
            "review_text": "Kat K\n2 contributions\n0\nGreat quick coffee stop\nApr 2016 • Solo\nGreat coffee shop, prices are cheap with good Vietnamese coffee. Seems to be more of a local spot, less tourists, friendly stud. They offer some Vietnamese dishes as well for very very reasonable prices and the dishes are made from a stand right near the coffee shop. 15,000 dong for coffee and 10,000 dong for two pieces of spring rolls, deals for a light breakfast for about $1 and some change.\nRead more\nWritten April 17, 2016",
